# Master Pakku {1}{U}, 1/3 Prowess: "Whenever Master Pakku becomes tapped, target player mills X cards, where X is the number of Lesson cards in YOUR
# graveyard" (CR 701.17a, 205.3k). Casting Entomb (a noncreature spell) on turn 1 gives prowess +1/+1 until end of turn (2/4, back to 1/3 next turn). Entomb
# puts Accumulate Wisdom (a Lesson) into Bot1's graveyard. Turn 3: attacking taps Pakku, X is 1, and Bot2 mills exactly one card: its Airbending Lesson.
# Turn 5, a second Entomb having put Airbending Lesson in Bot1's graveyard, X is 2 - not 3, for the Lesson now in Bot2's own graveyard stays uncounted -
# so Bot2 mills exactly two more cards, Mountain and Forest, with its turn-4 draw (Swamp) between.

